Algol 68 Genie is a well-featured Algol 68 interpreter. It can be used 
for executing Algol 68 programs or scripts. Algol 68 is a rather lean 
orthogonal general-purpose language that is a beautiful means for 
denoting algorithms. Algol 68 Genie is free software, distributed under 
GNU General Public License.

I have posted Algol 68 Genie Mark 15.1 at

http://www.xs4all.nl/~jmvdveer/algol.html

Changes with respect to the previous release:
* adds Laplace transform
* regression fixes and documentation updates

I would like to thank all persons who have helped over the past years.
Algol 68 Genie would not be what it is without their help.

Marcel van der Veer

